{
  "version": "7cdd1644d82917a2",
  "duration": 86.955,
  "voice": "af_sky",
  "audioSha256": "a98cb549c6c984ece4ac22fd8914c1fe24b72bcc12b2d353124a64cf306f25d1",
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.64,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 0,
          "start": 939,
          "end": 1054
        }
      ],
      "text": "Applicants are manufacturers and distributors of mifepristone, a drug that is primarily designed to cause abortion."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.64,
      "end": 13.52,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 0,
          "start": 1055,
          "end": 1159
        }
      ],
      "text": "They complain that the Fifth Circuit’s order would reduce profits they derive from selling mifepristone."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.52,
      "end": 19.825,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 0,
          "start": 1160,
          "end": 1265
        }
      ],
      "text": "I would deny their applications because they have not satisfied their burden for securing interim relief."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.825,
      "end": 26.18,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 0,
          "start": 1266,
          "end": 1393
        }
      ],
      "text": "I write separately to note that, as Louisiana argued below, it is a criminal offense to ship mifepristone for use in abortions."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.18,
      "end": 31.92,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 0,
          "start": 1394,
          "end": 1441
        },
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 62,
          "end": 102
        }
      ],
      "text": "The Comstock Act bans using “the mails” to ship any “drug... for producing abortion.”"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.92,
      "end": 42.68,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 122,
          "end": 328
        }
      ],
      "text": "A neighboring provision makes it a felony to use “any express company or other common carrier or interactive computer service” to ship “any drug... designed, adapted, or intended for producing abortion.”"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.68,
      "end": 50.74,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 339,
          "end": 478
        }
      ],
      "text": "Applicants “ship mifepristone... to certified pharmacies,” which, in turn, must “ship mifepristone using a shipping service” to users."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.74,
      "end": 59.2,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 733,
          "end": 855
        }
      ],
      "text": "As relevant to this case, mifepristone shipped to Louisiana, which bans abortion, causes nearly 1,000 abortions per month."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.2,
      "end": 62.03,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 856,
          "end": 896
        }
      ],
      "text": "“All of this violates the Comstock Act.”"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.03,
      "end": 68.56,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 1068,
          "end": 1185
        }
      ],
      "text": "Applicants are not entitled to a stay of an adverse court order based on lost profits from their criminal enterprise."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.56,
      "end": 75.94,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 1186,
          "end": 1324
        }
      ],
      "text": "They cannot, in any legally relevant sense, be irreparably harmed by a court order that makes it more difficult for them to commit crimes."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.94,
      "end": 84.38,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 1325,
          "end": 1523
        }
      ],
      "text": "And, whereas it would “serve the public interest” to “reduce” applicants’ “opportunity to commit crimes,” a stay would have the opposite effect."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.38,
      "end": 86.605,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "start": 1524,
          "end": 1547
        }
      ],
      "text": "I respectfully dissent."
    }
  ],
